  "bio": "Megan Wilhite, based in Plano, United States, is a highly skilled illustrative tattoo artist whose deft touch brings art to life on skin with impeccable precision. Clients frequently praise Megan for her thorough professionalism that makes each tattoo session an enjoyable and trustworthy experience. Whether it's a delicate floral design or an intricate geometric pattern, Megan ensures that each piece is a masterpiece that stands the test of time. #meganmagenta\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Plano, Texas, United States"
